    {
      "id": "cJqIIC5g7qoDXimdB7Ahf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6475.832026163731,
      "y": -3975.694409179693,
      "width": 2347.84765625,
      "height": 765,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 182872843,
      "version": 323,
      "versionNonce": 1344572837,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808452793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS \n\n- USER MANAGEMENT (Auth & Profiles): Secure registration/login for customers and role-based access control (RBAC) for admins. \nCustomers must be able to view their booking history.\n\n- DYNAMIC CATALOG: A structured way to display the 6 core services \n(Bus Hire, Driving School, Delivery, Travel & Tour, Mechanics, Towing) with dynamic pricing and media.\n\n- BOOKING AND SCHEDULING: \nCustomers must be able to select a service, pick dates/times, provide necessary location details, and confirm a slot.\n\n-PAYMENT PROCESSING: Integration with a payment gateway (like Paystack or Flutterwave) to handle\n MTN Mobile Money, Visa, MasterCard, and PayPal.\n\n-ADMIN DASHBOARD: Interfaces for management to view/approve bookings, track revenue, manage users, and update service details.\n\n-NOTIFICATIONS:Automated email and or WhatsApp confirmations for bookings and payment receipts.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS \n\n- USER MANAGEMENT (Auth & Profiles): Secure registration/login for customers and role-based access control (RBAC) for admins. \nCustomers must be able to view their booking history.\n\n- DYNAMIC CATALOG: A structured way to display the 6 core services \n(Bus Hire, Driving School, Delivery, Travel & Tour, Mechanics, Towing) with dynamic pricing and media.\n\n- BOOKING AND SCHEDULING: \nCustomers must be able to select a service, pick dates/times, provide necessary location details, and confirm a slot.\n\n-PAYMENT PROCESSING: Integration with a payment gateway (like Paystack or Flutterwave) to handle\n MTN Mobile Money, Visa, MasterCard, and PayPal.\n\n-ADMIN DASHBOARD: Interfaces for management to view/approve bookings, track revenue, manage users, and update service details.\n\n-NOTIFICATIONS:Automated email and or WhatsApp confirmations for bookings and payment receipts.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D_wi66m9aiU31fy38WY69",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6518.498692830398,
      "y": -3067.194409179693,
      "width": 2613.9127779925307,
      "height": 3627.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1352323499,
      "version": 842,
      "versionNonce": 477121323,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808452793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n2. NON FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS \n    -SECURITY: SSL/TLS encryption for all data in transit. Passwords must be hashed (e.g., bcrypt).\n    Payment data must not be stored on your servers (offload to the gateway).\n\n    -RELIABILITY AND IDEMPOTENCY: Webhooks from payment gateways must be idempotent \n    (if MTN MoMo sends the same \"payment successful\" webhook twice, the system shouldn't credit the user twice).\n\n    -PERFORMANCE: API response times should be under 200ms. High-quality images of vehicles/services need CDN delivery to ensure fast loading.\n\n    -SCALABILITY: The architecture should support scaling the backend independently from the database, especially during peak travel seasons.\n\n\n3. CORE ENTITIES AND MODELS (DATABASE SCHEMA) \nGiven the highly relational nature of bookings, users, and transactions, a relational database like PostgreSQL is the perfect fit.\n\nUSER\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -role (Enum: CUSTOMER, ADMIN)\n\n    -name, email, phone_number, password_hash\n\n    -created_at, updated_at\n\n\n\nSERVICE\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -category (Enum: BUS_HIRE, TOWING, DELIVERY, etc.)\n\n    -name, description, base_price, image_url\n\n    -is_active (Boolean)\n\nBOOKING\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -user_id (FK -> User)\n\n    -service_id (FK -> Service)\n\n    -status (Enum: PENDING, CONFIRMED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED)\n\n    -booking_date, service_date\n\n    -special_instructions (Text)\n\n    -total_amount (Decimal)\n\nPAYMENT\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -booking_id (FK -> Booking)\n\n    -gateway_reference (String, unique - from Paystack/Hubtel)\n\n    -amount (Decimal)\n\n    -currency (String, default 'GHS')\n\n    -status (Enum: PENDING, SUCCESS, FAILED)\n\n    -payment_method (Enum: MOMO, CARD)\n\nREVIEW\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -user_id (FK -> User)\n\n    -service_id (FK -> Service)\n\n    -rating (Int 1-5)\n\n    -comment (Text)",
      "fontSize": 36.275,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n2. NON FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS \n    -SECURITY: SSL/TLS encryption for all data in transit. Passwords must be hashed (e.g., bcrypt).\n    Payment data must not be stored on your servers (offload to the gateway).\n\n    -RELIABILITY AND IDEMPOTENCY: Webhooks from payment gateways must be idempotent \n    (if MTN MoMo sends the same \"payment successful\" webhook twice, the system shouldn't credit the user twice).\n\n    -PERFORMANCE: API response times should be under 200ms. High-quality images of vehicles/services need CDN delivery to ensure fast loading.\n\n    -SCALABILITY: The architecture should support scaling the backend independently from the database, especially during peak travel seasons.\n\n\n3. CORE ENTITIES AND MODELS (DATABASE SCHEMA) \nGiven the highly relational nature of bookings, users, and transactions, a relational database like PostgreSQL is the perfect fit.\n\nUSER\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -role (Enum: CUSTOMER, ADMIN)\n\n    -name, email, phone_number, password_hash\n\n    -created_at, updated_at\n\n\n\nSERVICE\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -category (Enum: BUS_HIRE, TOWING, DELIVERY, etc.)\n\n    -name, description, base_price, image_url\n\n    -is_active (Boolean)\n\nBOOKING\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -user_id (FK -> User)\n\n    -service_id (FK -> Service)\n\n    -status (Enum: PENDING, CONFIRMED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED)\n\n    -booking_date, service_date\n\n    -special_instructions (Text)\n\n    -total_amount (Decimal)\n\nPAYMENT\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -booking_id (FK -> Booking)\n\n    -gateway_reference (String, unique - from Paystack/Hubtel)\n\n    -amount (Decimal)\n\n    -currency (String, default 'GHS')\n\n    -status (Enum: PENDING, SUCCESS, FAILED)\n\n    -payment_method (Enum: MOMO, CARD)\n\nREVIEW\n\n    -id (UUID, PK)\n\n    -user_id (FK -> User)\n\n    -service_id (FK -> Service)\n\n    -rating (Int 1-5)\n\n    -comment (Text)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Rk_UYzTuj2FjZ0FijcKIm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6463.332026163732,
      "y": 619.3055908203069,
      "width": 2070.035400390625,
      "height": 1215,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1011442763,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 1508741381,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808452793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. API ENDPOINTS (REST) \n\nAUTH:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/auth/register - Create a new user account.\n\n    -POST /api/v1/auth/login - Authenticate and return JWT.\n\nSERVICES:\n\n    -GET /api/v1/services - List all active services.\n\n    -GET /api/v1/services/{id} - Get details of a specific service.\n\nBOOKINGS:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/bookings - Create a new booking (requires Auth).\n    \n    -GET /api/v1/bookings/me - Get current user's booking history.\n\n    -PATCH /api/v1/bookings/{id}/status - Admin only: Update booking status.\n\nPAYMENTS:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/payments/initialize - Trigger the MoMo/Card prompt via gateway.\n\n    -POST /api/v1/payments/webhook - Crucial endpoint. Listens for the gateway to confirm payment success/failure.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. API ENDPOINTS (REST) \n\nAUTH:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/auth/register - Create a new user account.\n\n    -POST /api/v1/auth/login - Authenticate and return JWT.\n\nSERVICES:\n\n    -GET /api/v1/services - List all active services.\n\n    -GET /api/v1/services/{id} - Get details of a specific service.\n\nBOOKINGS:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/bookings - Create a new booking (requires Auth).\n    \n    -GET /api/v1/bookings/me - Get current user's booking history.\n\n    -PATCH /api/v1/bookings/{id}/status - Admin only: Update booking status.\n\nPAYMENTS:\n\n    -POST /api/v1/payments/initialize - Trigger the MoMo/Card prompt via gateway.\n\n    -POST /api/v1/payments/webhook - Crucial endpoint. Listens for the gateway to confirm payment success/failure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
